OL,3,ATech treating AI like humans is
OL,4,Amistaken and misguided, Microsoft boss
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to the BBC's Today programme,
OL,8,FMustafa Suleyman said it is "right"
OL,9,Fthat people are concerned or alarmed,
OL,10,Fbut there are "very practical things
OL,11,Fthat we can do to add additional
OL,12,Fguardrails and controls to how these
OL,13,Fmodels are developed".
OL,15,FThe comments are the latest in a series
OL,16,Fof stark warnings from the AI industry
OL,17,Fon the possible dangers of the
OL,18,Ftechnology.
